A Stacked screen layout: the TV picture on the top half and the GamePad picture on the bottom half, each the full width
of the frame, so the output is twice as tall as one screen (1280x1440 at 720p) and its aspect 8:9. The app cuts the two
halves into its own screens. Touch maps through the same viewport, so it lands on the bottom half.

